---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="VAN & Existing Tools | Arkansas Campaign Data Cooperative" description="Use enhanced L2 data and Electd without abandoning VAN. Match, append, and strengthen the tools campaigns already know.">
<section class="page-hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / VAN</p>
        <p class="brand-lockup">Keep using what works</p>
        <h1 transition:name="page-title">Keep using VAN—make the information stronger.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">The goal is not to replace every system. The goal is to make the systems campaigns already trust more accurate and more useful.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-van">
      <div class="section-inner narrow">
        <h2 >Strengthen records. Don’t abandon tools.</h2>
        <p>Organizations that rely on VAN can use enhanced information to identify missing contact fields, correct outdated records, and improve communication with voters.</p>
        <p>Depending on technical and licensing requirements, data can be prepared for matching, updating, appending, or importing into existing workflows—including VAN and the <a href="/platform/" style="color:#ffd2b0">Electd</a> platform.</p>
        <p class="emphasis">Campaigns do not have to abandon the tools they already know.</p>
        <p class="emphasis-strong">They can strengthen them.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="drill-grid">
          <article class="drill-card">
            <h3>Feed Electd</h3>
            <p>Cleaner phones and emails mean better self-serve and managed outreach on Electd. <a href="/platform/">Platform →</a> · <a href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">electd.io</a></p>
          </article>
          <article class="drill-card">
            <h3>Feed from L2</h3>
            <p>Enhanced L2 fields are designed for traditional and digital targeting lists. <a href="/data/">L2 data →</a> · <a href="https://l2-data.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">l2-data.com</a></p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/join/?intent=demo">Schedule a demonstration</a>
      </div>
    </section>

</BaseLayout>

